<title>Colombia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/colombia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-colombia-2026-11-26T02:57:34.942Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:57:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Colombian security forces stormed a supermarket in Cartagena, freeing all 20 hostages after gunmen held them for 17 hours and killing one attacker. The president blamed ex-FARC rebels for a car bomb that injured more than 20 people in a central city and for another bomb at the governor's office in Meta. The ELN carried out a drone strike on a police base, wounding three people including an infant. Violence remains high, with 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/25/hostages-freed-colombia-security-forces-storm-cartagena-supermarket&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/world/americas/colombia-blackout-terrorist-attack.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/world/americas/colombia-farc-peace-deal.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/business/2026/11/25/terrorist-attack-caused-major-blackout-colombia-president-says/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckp80mjr9emyo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPUXk2MmFURDEwYmxvTFItajUwUC1YQWVXMDNYSXh5MTBDV1A5Y1ROb1FRajhCTVZQMkh6SnRXNmJENElGOWVnLXFqSWFqLXZleTRwc2RieDFvYzRGWDRHd2ZmclFVSzk3NFN0bmI3ZkJtbHJfNV81dWtoeWEzNmVvN3dpZ0Q4dF8zVjV3WU1xOXpPMHRUVnNzMjd1REx0ZHloZ29ZWjlNajVwSS1LeTBHek9WSmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/25/colombia-security-forces-storm-supermarket-where-hostages-are-being-held&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/24/cartagena-colombia-hostages-supermarket&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQQjNScGtXdE5ITXdHX0FHZkVNZUxHMFBfeFI0WTdEa1FXX09iQ3Ffbjk3M212NVRtUnNNWDNDNFdfRWNjQUlXemtwTjF6UHBLMno0ZXo4alU2emF0TnRzLVo5TXNjbGJHX0ZZbGU2R1ZHZHBIT0VOX1N5UDRCeFdMQkhGM09rZWRoc1VRVWFFSDNBdzM5SEFwN2ZxM0cyUnU2T09TMG5kT1ZzUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
